# MyTailorBook Cursor Rules

## Mandatory Component Mount & Integration Testing
- Whenever developing or fixing features in MyTailorBook, write Vitest + happy-dom + @testing-library/react component tests.
- Pure unit tests of isolated logic functions alone are forbidden as sole verification for UI features.
- Test Rich, Sparse, and Edge-Case data states.
- Verify user clicks, inputs, and state changes.

## Development Constraints
- Zero Emojis in code, commits, and UI copy.
- Never use the words "atelier" or "specialist embellishment".
- Push exclusively to `origin staging`. Never merge to `main`.
- Ensure `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run test:unit` pass cleanly.
